  "_comment": [
    "Editable keyword aliases. Matching is case-insensitive.",
    "synonyms: true two-way equivalents (AI = Artificial Intelligence). Either side matches the other.",
    "variants: one-way. Resume wording on the right counts as the JD keyword on the left (alias tier, full credit), not the reverse: 'aws' satisfies Cloud Computing, but 'cloud' never satisfies AWS. Phrases listed here skip the head-word evidence rule.",
    "A trailing * matches any word ending: 'prioritiz*' covers prioritize, prioritized, prioritization.",
    "related: sibling groups (MySQL ~ PostgreSQL). A keyword with no other match earns partial 'related' credit only from a listed sibling in its group; sharing a word like 'management' is never enough."
